{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて読んでくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントしてくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は映画告白を鑑賞しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は昨日夜も観たんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう一回観たくて観てしまった‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は何観ようかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の作品を観て勉強しよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アニメ見る？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジブリやサマーウォーズみたいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アニメはすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段はあんま見ない人です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おおかみこどもの雨と雪 観たい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服を買いに行って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとお金に余裕があったら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何に一番お金をかける？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴...かな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソラニンって何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃがいもの芽の毒だそうです^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑がりー？寒がりー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑がりだと思う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"罰ゲームで飲んだ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"センブリ茶ってどんな味だった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガチで激まず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦いを通り越した苦さ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飲んだ後も舌に残ってて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ち悪くなった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良い子は飲まないでね☆←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「１６人のプリンシパル」で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番のお気に入りのシーンって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこだった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一幕の最後AKB48さんの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「蕾たち」を歌ったシーン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鏡見て表情を作る練習は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"したりするの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"するよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみには緑のおかずとみたらし団子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーんしてもらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日載せ忘れたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニットの形はこんな感じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいんだよね、まったくだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってさ、ちまが近くにいるときに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が他のメンバーとしゃべってたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「まりか～」って言ってきて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとすねるんだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外でしょ⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/18/7207072/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかはひなちまのこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまってるぞー"},{"type":"image","src":"https:/